Third-party material
--------------------

- Archivo (fonts/archivo.woff2): a subset of the variable font the app ships
  (app/src/main/res/font/archivo_variable.ttf), cut down to Latin with the
  weight axis at 300-800 and the width axis at 100-125.
  Copyright The Archivo Project Authors. SIL Open Font License 1.1, full text in
  licenses/Archivo-OFL.txt.

Written for this page, with no third-party code
-----------------------------------------------

- js/fluid.js: the liquid inside the band, a GPU fluid solver in WebGL2. It is
  written from scratch and implements the published method from Jos Stam's "Stable
  Fluids" (SIGGRAPH 1999): semi-Lagrangian advection, a Jacobi pressure solve and
  gradient subtraction. The pass structure is the common one also used in Pavel
  Dobryakov's MIT-licensed WebGL-Fluid-Simulation, but no code was copied from it.
- js/spring.js, js/vessel.js, js/main.js: springs with the app's parameters
  (Motion.kt), and the app's vessel drawn as in core/design/Liquid.kt.

Images
------

- img/*.webp: screenshots of the Fulla app, with invented demo data, taken
  from the repository's `screenshots` branch and converted to WebP. No stock images
  or videos are used.

The page makes no external requests. It has no analytics and sets no cookies.
